AREAS OF APPLICATION | PACKAGING
 | 20 kg
 • Waterprooﬁng water tanks, fountains, artiﬁcial lakes and other RCC retaining structures, etc. •
 Below-grade structures subjected to positive or negative water pressure. • Waterprooﬁng and
 protection of concrete foundations, retaining walls and foundation slabs. • Tunnels, subways &
 stations, inspection pits & lift shafts • Retaining walls & sea defence walls. • Construction joints.
 • Bridge decks, jetties. • Parking structures. • Swimming pool, wet areas.
