STORAGE
Mandatory and recommended industrial hygiene procedures should be followed whenever our products are being handled
and used. For additional information please read Material Safety Data Sheet.
Product should be stored in a dry place in their original, properly closed containers/ bags at temperatures between 2 - 40°C
on pellets. Bag should be consumed once opened.
